-- Sprint 3 Task fixtures: #175 / #203 / #206. APTITUDE or a disposable QA DB.
-- Generated by scripts/build/generate-sprint3-task-seed.mjs; edit the generator.
-- Not a schema migration. Run the WHOLE file in ONE connection; stop on SQL error.
-- Register three ordinary accounts manually first. No user/password/token imports.
-- Existing application rows are NEVER updated/deleted, including shared Mini Fridge.
-- Missing records are inserted only if ALL preflight checks pass.
-- Used (checked-in/Sold), conflicting or ambiguous fixtures BLOCK writes.
